cope preserved.\"\n+  },\n+  \"header_unchanged_sha256\": \"92e0dcfac53595e35b68bfd8083c09640d06da809355ab02ec4eb4b007b0bd67\",\n+  \"source_pixel_review\": \"Personally inspected PDF141,142,278,279 in immediately preceding source review; no new PDF or BODY input needed. Source-header-review-v1.json pins each viewed pixel.\",\n+  \"scope_boundary\": \"No header/binder mutation, freeze, proof authorization, source correction closure, status update or verified analytic route. All7 containers+6future claims and mandatory B4 endpoints remain open.\"\n+}"},{"sha":"a60b25b273b3aed2e5efdb8a5e1f6139c046f427","filename":"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/source-header-topology/topology-proposal-v2.md","status":"added","additions":15,"deletions":0,"changes":15,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Fsource-header-topology%2Ftopology-proposal-v2.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Fsource-header-topology%2Ftopology-proposal-v2.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Fsource-header-topology%2Ftopology-proposal-v2.md?ref=c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@\n+# B4 finite-identity topology v2 — proposal\n+\n+Repairs T1–T4 from independent review701e22c6...; distinct review remains required. HEADER92e0... is unchanged. No BODY was read or produced, and no freeze or source-target acceptance is issued.\n+\n+All17 previous node IDs remain, with old/new claim fingerprints and explicit version mappings; four exclusions are identical. Twelve nodes are added. The literal sharp7.47 and15.31 claim texts remain unchanged. Corrected sharp, Young and BTRL endpoints have their own declared IDs and unverified AND edges. No dangling edge remains. Source narrative edges are separate from proposed corrected obligations and do not certify any printed or analytic route.\n+\n+T1 adds explicit dispositions for prediction generation/perfect-hint motivation, the FTRL reinterpretation, real-round existence and uniqueness via Lemma7.5/Theorem6.9, Lemma7.1 comparator-gap discard, initial-minimum substitution, BTRL perfect-hint specialization, zero-regularizer BTL and gradient-term interpretation. Citation applicability, support, finiteness and attainment stay OPEN. Context excluded from this algebra leaf remains owned by its original target.\n+\n+T2 separates immutable literal claims from CORRECTED-7.47-SHARP, CORRECTED-7.47-YOUNG and CORRECTED-15.31. They are obligations, not verified alternatives.\n+\n+T3 fixes indexing: source s=1..T maps leaf t=s-1; source G_T is leaf G(T-1). Source last played x_T is leaf x(T-1). BTRL ghost is therefore z=x(T-1), with y(T)=z. Original leaf x(T) is unused; leaf G(T) would include an extra loss. Arbitrary z never obtains a gap-sign assumption from notation.\n+\n+T4 separates legal virtual repetition from the invalid cancellation. Repeating the final hint/regularizer leaves all real rounds unchanged. The defect is deleting the residual hint_T(u)-hint_T(z), producing the witnessed false sharp completion. Repetition itself and all corrected/Young alternatives are not labeled invalid.\n+\n+The finite real identity remains the sole proposed leaf. Full EReal transport, qualified optimizer existence, same-support/strong-convex stability and both corrected regret bounds remain mandatory OPEN. All7+6 chapter obligations stay unchanged."},{"sha":"93a7f5dc29ebaff145145097bac7182d3501e86f","filename":"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/source-originals/page-141.png","status":"added","additions":0,"deletions":0,"changes":0,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Fsource-originals%2Fpage-141.png","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Fsource-originals%2Fpage-141.png","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Fsource-originals%2Fpage-141.png?ref=c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47"},{"sha":"89532cd397a510e2472410bea0025078a9c71605","filename":"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/source-originals/page-142.png","status":"added","additions":0,"deletions":0,"changes":0,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Fsource-originals%2Fpage-142.png","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Fsource-originals%2Fpage-142.png","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Fsource-originals%2Fpage-142.png?ref=c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47"},{"sha":"5dd38bfd046620d966b7a6db9506edc1311a6a7a","filename":"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/source-originals/page-278.png","status":"added","additions":0,"deletions":0,"changes":0,"blob_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/blob/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Fsource-originals%2Fpage-278.png","raw_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/raw/c445c93f7e4cda1408279d614858c904e346ad47/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Fsource-originals%2Fpage-278.png","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/contents/runs%2Fonline-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011%2Fso