even Chapter2 containers and six future claims remain open; Chapter2 partial,accepted=false,complete proof denominator=null; Chapters1-16 Goal ACTIVE. Unmerged/unpublished; no main/live/PURIFIED/native whole-loop claim.\",\n+  \"verification\": {\n+    \"focused_checks\": [\n+      \"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/production-core/core-report-v2.json SHA256 5c55e8ea41cf2c18af4c47f9929233e7e4afcf903de00f654fd00edec1ab98aa\",\n+      \"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/independent-production-body/fresh-production-body-review-v1.json SHA256 4b3246ef699eba8c3df7a8063e12342f86211c43b60efd121ce2bccb58c8aac6\",\n+      \"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/production-core/compiled-constant-occurrences-v3.json SHA256 7fc98eedc77882cc97cc9923f50073b79991b96e547fe1c8d1ec4f4dcd82f6f1\",\n+      \"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/production-core/native-statement-fence-v1.json SHA256 fbb95c63f220167e999642845485f6e8bd1f446fd85f5d41122983ea4ee6c46d\",\n+      \"Core source hash per independently reviewed evidence 61c811c0b1f941ec22ac41f64e555a0e4d4d8dc32b8145ea53808dbdc0fc17da; no BODY read by metadata author.\",\n+      \"Selected actual direct VALUE Nat.recAux, Finset.sum_range_succ, Finset.sum_range_zero, Nat.sub_add_cancel; no project-owned direct VALUE parents; occurrence not necessity/transitive graph.\",\n+      \"Tests\\\\OnlineCumulativePotentialCanary.lean SHA256 a3f7a41bf1ddd25a4a623c865c028e029af267132faaeef9c70f9d28e3a30a8f\",\n+      \"runs\\\\online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011\\\\canary-core\\\\canary-core-report-v1.json SHA256 fd2b0d06cdc28dc9c4bd1da9bd72a7112ad7872097a8778a16143ebb9fd8b03f\",\n+      \"runs\\\\online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011\\\\independent-canary-body\\\\fresh-canary-body-review-v1.json SHA256 1547b91ce76afe56c7c7a54be446887b8058fb071e4ddb32e4e48547bf33b8f3\"\n+    ],\n+    \"bandit_check\": \"Actual clean committed candidate root/Tests/full-harness receipts and bounded FINAL acceptance are recorded separately in this RUN; focused tests do not substitute for these gates.\",\n+    \"site_build\": \"Actual plain preflight and Lean-verified build after successful same-candidate full harness are recorded separately in this RUN.\",\n+    \"site_check\": \"Actual official check, old-object/registry preservation and isolated local reader pixel review are recorded separately in this RUN; no live verification claim.\",\n+    \"independent_review\": \"Production and both public canary BODY candidates independently accepted. Reader three-append plan and timely V3 status reviewed. Fresh shared root/Tests/full harness, current contributor/process gates, official site/structural/reader QA and bounded FINAL acceptance remain required in this RUN.\"\n+  },\n+  \"contributor\": {\n+    \"name\": \"ABRL agent-assisted finite-real cumulative identity\",\n+    \"role\": \"Draft bounded corrected-algebra integration; authorship unchanged.\"\n+  },\n+  \"learning_contract\": {\n+    \"control_plane_math_authority\": false,\n+    \"process_memory_checked\": true,\n+    \"process_memory_ids\": [\n+      \"ABRL-PM-MATCHED-HARNESS-EVIDENCE\",\n+      \"ABRL-PM-ATOMIC-SOURCE-ASSUMPTIONS\"\n+    ],\n+    \"failure_class\": \"NONE\",\n+    \"salvage\": {\n+      \"required\": true,\n+      \"status\": \"completed\",\n+      \"reason\": \"Current production candidate recovered; core report retains IMPLEMENTATION_FAILED redundant simp and ENV_BLOCKED probe path/option attempts. No algebra refutation or scheduler change inferred. Source-invalid cancellation is separately limited in topology, not current proof failure. Canary time-binder annotation failure and pre-canary ZIP governance omission are retained as implementation/environment repairs, with exact earlier receipts. All old mathematical targets retained.\",\n+      \"promoted_fragments\": [\n+        \"BanditRL.OnlineCumulativePotential.finite_regret_identity\",\n+        \"BanditRL.OnlineCumulativePotentialCanary.finite_identity_