true,clean manifest and new node compiled; source-only preflight cannot pass these predicates.\",\n+    \"Frozen source inventory/core/Test pins plus C2partial/acceptedfalse/null/7+6 enforced.\",\n+    \"No full source topology or transitive graph/render claim; human visual review separate.\"\n+  ],\n+  \"limits\": [\n+    \"Not hardcoded to1322 rows: actual counts must equal re-enumerated current set and receipt counts, avoiding a misleading fixed-count-only check.\",\n+    \"Exact new append mathematical contents rely on approved source candidate binding and separate integration review; this script checks their identity and preservation structure.\",\n+    \"Output restricted to own ignored QA namespace and create-only, with recorded actual failure if runtime assertions fail.\"\n+  ],\n+  \"inputs\": [\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"E:/ABRL/worktrees/research-online-book/tmp/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-structural-qa-20261011/check-b4-structure-v1.py\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"b876af326bab48f05f6e85dc40a0db65643851748eab698168fc13a5a21f84ad\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"E:/ABRL/worktrees/research-online-book/tmp/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-structural-qa-20261011/input-spec-v1.json\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"f3bdb4f0e108060dd676b190f6e8b1fd4fce422fc35abfc8c22358b59b73f3b7\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"E:/ABRL/worktrees/research-online-book/tmp/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-structural-qa-20261011/preparation-v1.json\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"f72f8993aa1c0fe9a11d7b74a0903f7e4adf39723779051176b96bfbe8558985\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"path\": \"E:/ABRL/worktrees/research-online-book/tmp/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-structural-qa-20261011/run-after-parent-confirmation-v1.txt\",\n+      \"sha256\": \"aa1cd7cfd3e29d6e6aef291338caeddcc1bf73d0645b91799035511e7997c80e\"\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"executed\": false,\n+  \"no_canonical_changes\": true\n+}"},{"sha":"d297bc5f2caee81b8b3a80a342cd6fc0855f2625","filename":"runs/online-ch2-b4-finite-identity-20261011/struc